    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG has great pleasure in presenting this superb two-bedroom ground-floor apartment extending to 77 sq.m/829 sq.ft. This inviting apartment is in excellent condition throughout and has been superbly maintained by the current owners.\n\nSet in the ever-popular development of Galloping Green, popular with first-time buyers, professionals, investors and those trading down alike. Galloping Green enjoys an enviable location just off the Stillorgan Road. This gated development is superbly maintained with communal landscaped gardens, lift access, secure residence parking as well as visitors parking.\n\nNo. 101 is a well maintained two-bedroom apartment located on the ground floor of this fantastic development. Accessed through electronic gates, this home offers excellent security and bright, fresh interiors. An entrance hall with storage cupboard and family shower room off leads through to the large open-plan living room/dining room with a separate kitchen/breakfast room. The living/dining room enjoys a dual aspect as well as access to the southwest facing patio which enjoys the afternoon and evening sun. There are two double bedrooms with built in wardrobes. The main bedroom has an en-suite.\n\nThere are residence and visitor parking spaces. The development enjoys access to the landscaped communal grounds with various seating and paved areas for the enjoyment of residents only.\n\nSituated adjacent to the Quality Bus Corridor (QBC), this location needs little introduction. Numerous and regular bus routes are literally on your doorstep and the City Centre is only 10km away. The villages of Blackrock, Mount Merrion & Stillorgan are also close by. UCD Belfield, Beacon Hospital & Blackrock Clinic are easily accessible with St. Vincent's Hospital a little further."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWith wooden flooring, phone intercom, a storeroom and hot-press.\n\nBathroom - \nWith tiled flooring and walls, w.c. wash hand basin, bath with shower attachment, bidet, wall mounted mirror and recessed lighting.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - \nWith wooden flooring, ceiling coving, dual aspect room, feature mantlepiece, tv/phone points, glass door to a southwest facing patio, feature wall lighting and door to the kitchen.\n\nKitchen/Breakfast Room - \nWith tiled flooring and tiled back splash, a range of floor and wall units, integrated oven/hobs, stainless steel sink with drainer, provision for fridge/freezer, plumbed for washer/dryer, plumbed for dish washer and spot lighting.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nDouble room with carpet flooring, built in wardrobes, tv/phone points, a window to the front and a door to the en-suite\n\nEn-Suite - \nWith tiled flooring and partly tiled walls, a window to the front, w.c. wash hand basin and shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nDouble room with carpet flooring, built in wardrobes and tv/phone points.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Turnkey two-bedroom ground floor apartment</li><li> Designated residence parking</li><li> Serviced by a lift</li><li> Southwest facing patio</li><li> Dual aspect living room</li><li> Communal gardens</li><li> Visitor parking</li><li> Secure gated development</li><li> Electric heating</ul>"
      },
